# Allowlist, not a blocklist. The repository is ~5 GB -- fixtures alone are
# 4.5 GB and the cassettes another 13 MB -- and every byte of it would
# otherwise be streamed to the daemon as build context on every build. What
# the wheel actually needs is ~2.7 MB.
#
# Docker evaluates the LAST matching pattern, so `*` excludes everything and
# each `!` line below adds one thing back. Adding a build-time dependency
# means adding it here too, or the build fails with a missing file rather
# than with anything that names this file.
*

# pyproject declares `readme` and `license-files`; setuptools>=77 fails the
# build if any of them are absent, so these are required, not documentation.
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!LICENSING.md
!spec

# The package itself. src/semlayer/spec/LICENSE and src/semlayer/export/LICENSE
# are two more entries in `license-files` and live under here.
!src
